<pb n="957"/>
      <head><title key="work-8972fdec-5dd2-413a-b151-cfaeacde9cbd">南齊書</title>·列傳·卷五十五·列傳第三十六·孝義·<persName key="person-7f68849f-f3d5-47e6-851f-b06a0ef70894">吳欣之</persName></head>
        <p><persName key="person-7f68849f-f3d5-47e6-851f-b06a0ef70894">吳欣之</persName>，<placeName key="place-641d61de-d400-4e34-85fa-79a633ad8585">晉陵</placeName><placeName key="place-ebd942a9-0653-4bb8-bb5f-e588b178c1dc">利城</placeName>人也。<note type="editor">[七]<placeName key="place-641d61de-d400-4e34-85fa-79a633ad8585">晉陵</placeName><placeName key="place-ebd942a9-0653-4bb8-bb5f-e588b178c1dc">利城</placeName>人也　錢大昕廿二史考異云：「按<placeName key="place-ebd942a9-0653-4bb8-bb5f-e588b178c1dc">利城縣</placeName>本屬<placeName key="place-9cd890c0-0d6e-425b-92eb-5bba7fdbb149">東海</placeName>，晉<placeName key="place-154b54b8-7ef0-4f63-bdaf-e9aba90c0c56">南渡</placeName>，僑立<placeName key="place-4454ef97-fc96-47d4-875a-6de0e07c9af0">江南</placeName>，宋、齊<title key="work-05f76258-fe5a-4bf8-9698-37282bc5913d">州郡志</title>俱屬<placeName key="place-775fdf7d-215e-4e27-ba5f-a2724752b9ab">南東海郡</placeName>。」</note>
<date resp="#ljb-sanmiao" cert="high" era_id="263" dyn_id="83" ruler_id="3853" cal_stream="1"><dyn>宋</dyn><era>元嘉</era><suffix>末</suffix></date>，弟<persName key="person-0e63ccc0-1823-4d82-8b58-2081f5f065ea">尉之</persName>為<placeName key="place-39096cc4-d9c7-440a-b826-8991eeb49c49">武進縣</placeName>戍，<nobleTitle><placeName>隨</placeName><roleName ref="NORBERT:office-1311">王</roleName></nobleTitle>誕起義，<date resp="#ljb-sanmiao" cert="high" dyn_id="83" ruler_id="2030" era_id="1304">太<choice><sic/><corr>初</corr></choice></date>遣<roleName key="office-fd4a8bf4-4b4a-4032-aa07-983deb1f5552">軍主</roleName><persName key="person-7f8d4696-6269-464b-8f3e-241a93bc4c6d">華欽</persName>討之，<note type="editor">[八]太<choice><sic>祖</sic><corr>初</corr></choice>遣<roleName key="office-fd4a8bf4-4b4a-4032-aa07-983deb1f5552">軍主</roleName><persName key="person-7f8d4696-6269-464b-8f3e-241a93bc4c6d">華欽</persName>討之　據局本改。按<persName key="person-1880e077-bd4a-42f8-8414-618b8601ed78">劉劭</persName>曾改元太初，故稱<persName key="person-1880e077-bd4a-42f8-8414-618b8601ed78">劭</persName>為太初。<title key="work-b57e516b-a9e2-4807-93b2-c5c2b6f7f787">南史</title>作「元凶遣<roleName key="office-fd4a8bf4-4b4a-4032-aa07-983deb1f5552">軍主</roleName><persName key="person-7f8d4696-6269-464b-8f3e-241a93bc4c6d">華欽</persName>討之」。又按「<persName key="person-7f8d4696-6269-464b-8f3e-241a93bc4c6d">華欽</persName>」<title key="work-22d2c37d-84e2-46c6-9bec-37663e18e7ee">宋書</title>二凶傳作「<persName key="person-7f8d4696-6269-464b-8f3e-241a93bc4c6d">燕欽</persName>」。</note>吏民皆散，<persName key="person-0e63ccc0-1823-4d82-8b58-2081f5f065ea">尉之</persName>獨留，見執將死。<persName key="person-7f68849f-f3d5-47e6-851f-b06a0ef70894">欣之</persName>詣<persName key="person-7f8d4696-6269-464b-8f3e-241a93bc4c6d">欽</persName>乞代弟命，辭淚哀切，<note type="editor">[九]辭淚哀切　「淚」元龜八百五十一作「旨」。</note>兄弟皆見原。<date resp="#ljb-sanmiao" cert="high" era_id="272" dyn_id="84" ruler_id="7605" cal_stream="1" year="3" ind_year="481" sex_year="58"><era>建元</era><year>三年</year></date>，<note type="editor">[一０]<date resp="#ljb-sanmiao" cert="high" era_id="272" dyn_id="84" ruler_id="7605" cal_stream="1" year="3" ind_year="481" sex_year="58"><era>建元</era><year>三年</year></date>　「<date resp="#ljb-sanmiao" cert="high" era_id="272" dyn_id="84" ruler_id="7605" cal_stream="1" year="3" ind_year="481" sex_year="58"><year>三年</year></date>」各本作「<date resp="#ljb-sanmiao" cert="high" era_id="272" dyn_id="84" ruler_id="7605" cal_stream="1" year="2" ind_year="480" sex_year="57"><year>二年</year></date>」。按<title key="work-b57e516b-a9e2-4807-93b2-c5c2b6f7f787">南史</title>作「<date resp="#ljb-sanmiao" cert="high" era_id="272" dyn_id="84" ruler_id="7605" cal_stream="1" year="3" ind_year="481" sex_year="58"><year>三年</year></date>」。</note>有詔蠲表。</p>
        <p><date resp="#ljb-sanmiao" cert="high" era_id="273" dyn_id="84" ruler_id="4361" cal_stream="1" year="1" ind_year="483" sex_year="60"><era>永明</era><suffix>初</suffix></date>，<placeName key="place-f87bcef0-d615-4b30-9a81-78572ad9dc0a">廣陵</placeName>民章起之二息犯罪爭死，<note type="editor">[一一]<placeName key="place-f87bcef0-d615-4b30-9a81-78572ad9dc0a">廣陵</placeName>民章起之二息犯罪爭死　「章起之」<title key="work-b57e516b-a9e2-4807-93b2-c5c2b6f7f787">南史</title>作「童起之」。</note>
<roleName key="office-5a7fef1c-472e-4313-a091-2bb7094097e8">太守</roleName><persName key="person-41aac222-a227-48cb-833d-2eaf363b13e7">劉悛</persName>表以聞。</p>
      </div>
